[chara_mod  name="Nicola"  time="200"  cross="false"  storage="chara/5/nicola_leaning_determined.png"  ]
The first time, I was like, yeah, sure, fine! [l]I guess it happens. [p]Sometimes you just screw up so bad you end up inverting the GCC process, even though you’re supposed to be a pro mechanic on a SPACE STATION! [p]

[playse storage=SoundEffects_Action/elevator_ding.ogg loop=false clear=false layer=2]
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_leaning_angry.png" wait=false time=450 cross=false]
