[fadeoutse time=1000 buf=3]
[playse storage=SoundEffects_Action/door1_soft.ogg loop=false clear=false layer=1]
[chara_mod  name="Nicola"  time="200"  cross="false"  storage="chara/5/nicola_leaning_angry_shout.png"  ]
That time, he just took a damn nap while this was all happening! [p]And now what?! [l]Once again! [l]I wake up, realizing my fucking head is upside down and I’m on the ceiling because some airhead just sucks at his job! [p]

